  "term": "family values",
  "definition": "Family values are the shared beliefs and expectations within a family about how members should relate to one another and carry out family roles. In the source packet, this includes themes such as obedience to parents, respect, protecting family honor, support among relatives, and culturally shaped expectations about parenting and gender roles.",
